# Day 31/60 — AI Supply Chain Control Tower

## Objective

Today I built an AI Supply Chain Control Tower that simulates how businesses monitor operational alerts, prioritize incidents, and make data-driven decisions using real-time dashboards.

The simulator allows users to experience how AI-assisted operations improve supply chain visibility, efficiency, and responsiveness.

