## What I Learned

### Real-Time Visibility Is Essential

Organizations need immediate access to operational insights to respond before disruptions escalate.

### Prioritization Matters

Not every alert requires the same level of attention. AI helps identify the incidents with the greatest business impact.

### KPIs Drive Better Decisions

Monitoring operational metrics in real time helps teams evaluate the effectiveness of their actions and continuously improve performance.

### AI Enhances Operational Efficiency

AI-powered control towers reduce response times, improve decision making, and increase overall supply chain resilience.

